# WN22-00-000100: Windows Server 2022 must be maintained at a supported servicing level.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-00-000100-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 must be maintained at a supported servicing level.`
    description `Systems at unsupported servicing levels will not receive security updates for new vulnerabilities, which leave them subject to exploitation. Systems must be maintained at a servicing level supported by the vendor with new security updates.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,registry,reg-sz,medium,ksi-cmt-lmc,ksi-cmt-rmv,ksi-mla-evc,ksi-svc-acm`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI:KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI:KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI:KSI-SVC-ACM,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI-SVC-ACM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Update the system to a Version 21H2 (Build 20348.xxx) or greater.`

    component_id `comp-windows-registry`

    impl_KSI_CMT_LMC `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-LMC by setting registry value 'CurrentBuild' (REG_SZ) under 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion' to the STIG-required value. The ESP scanner reads the value via the registry CTN and fails the policy if the key is absent or the value does not match. Remediation sets the value via Group Policy or direct registry edit.`
    impl_KSI_CMT_RMV `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-RMV by setting registry value 'CurrentBuild' (REG_SZ) under 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion' to the STIG-required value. The ESP scanner reads the value via the registry CTN and fails the policy if the key is absent or the value does not match. Remediation sets the value via Group Policy or direct registry edit.`
    impl_KSI_MLA_EVC `Windows Server implements KSI-MLA-EVC by setting registry value 'CurrentBuild' (REG_SZ) under 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion' to the STIG-required value. The ESP scanner reads the value via the registry CTN and fails the policy if the key is absent or the value does not match. Remediation sets the value via Group Policy or direct registry edit.`
    impl_KSI_SVC_ACM `Windows Server implements KSI-SVC-ACM by setting registry value 'CurrentBuild' (REG_SZ) under 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion' to the STIG-required value. The ESP scanner reads the value via the registry CTN and fails the policy if the key is absent or the value does not match. Remediation sets the value via Group Policy or direct registry edit.`
    impl_CM_6 `Windows Server implements CM-6 by setting registry value 'CurrentBuild' (REG_SZ) under 'HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion' to the STIG-required value. The ESP scanner reads the value via the registry CTN and fails the policy if the key is absent or the value does not match. Remediation sets the value via Group Policy or direct registry edit.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        hive `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE`
        key `SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion`
        name `CurrentBuild`
        behavior executor powershell
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int >= 20348
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN registry
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
